sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as FastAPI /search
    participant Ret as SemanticRetriever
    participant Emb as OpenAIEmbedder
    participant Store as ChunkStore
    participant PG as Postgres

    Client->>API: POST query + k
    alt k out of bounds or empty query
        API-->>Client: 422
    else no embedder or no async DB
        API-->>Client: 500 Embedding service is not available
    else ok
        API->>Ret: search(query, k)
        Ret->>Emb: embed_one(query) (to_thread)
        alt embed fails
            Emb-->>Ret: error
            Ret-->>API: error
            API-->>Client: 500 Failed to run semantic search
        else query vector
            Emb-->>Ret: vector
            Ret->>Store: search(vector, k)
            Store->>PG: SELECT cosine_distance LIMIT k
            PG-->>Store: rows (maybe empty)
            Store-->>Ret: rows
            Ret-->>API: results
            API-->>Client: 200 SearchResponse
        end
    end
